# Cairn mobile — environment variables
#
# Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill in. Values are read at build time
# by Expo. `.env.local` is NEVER committed.
#
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Apple code signing (native, build-time only — NOT bundled into the app)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Your Apple Developer team ID. Used by plugins/withAppleSigning.js to enable
# automatic on-device code signing during `expo prebuild`. If unset, the plugin
# is skipped (Xcode manual signing still works). Find it at:
# https://developer.apple.com/account → Membership → Team ID.
APPLE_TEAM_ID=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AI backend
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Chat and note AI actions need no build-time config: the user picks Apple
# Intelligence (when the device supports it) or adds an OpenAI-compatible base
# URL + API key in the app (Settings → AI). The key is stored in the device
# keychain.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Apple on-device AI (experimental, dev-only)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The on-device Apple Foundation Models model is EXPERIMENTAL and not viable for
# Cairn's agentic tool use — the model is too small / context too tight (fixed
# 4096 tokens). The USER-FACING Apple provider is Private Cloud Compute (below),
# NOT this. The on-device model is HIDDEN from end users.
#
# Set to 1 in your LOCAL .env.local to expose the on-device model in Settings →
# AI so you can keep iterating. Leave BLANK/unset for EAS and shipped builds.
# (The native module still compiles but stays dormant unless this flag is on.)
EXPO_PUBLIC_APPLE_LLM_DEV=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Apple Intelligence via Private Cloud Compute (iOS 27+)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PCC is the USER-FACING Apple provider: 32K context, stronger reasoning, no API
# key, privacy-preserving. It compiles in when built against the iOS 27+ SDK (the
# AppleLlm podspec auto-defines CAIRN_PCC_SDK) and runs on eligible iOS 27+
# devices.
#
# The managed entitlement `com.apple.developer.private-cloud-compute` is granted
# for com.gerardslee.cairn, so withPrivateCloudCompute adds it by default (EAS
# included). Set to 0 ONLY for an App ID without the grant — requesting an
# unprovisioned managed entitlement breaks code signing.
EXPO_PUBLIC_PCC=
